Subject: [PATCH] cli: separate branch topology groups without replacing operator positions

Fresh non-star graphs pinned the server's compact coordinates, bypassing the
existing layout and making the fixed-node collision force ineffective. Seed
all fresh graphs with the viewport-aware layout, retain centered mesh groups
for shallow branches without changing real parent edges, and repair cached
overlap with a bounded deterministic spacing pass. Keep Agent-1 anchored and
leave already separated positions unchanged. Parent changes no longer discard
operator node arrangements. Bump the script cache key for existing browsers.

Upstream-Status: Pending
